# WP22-REST (83688f54f): several runtime grids (Main 25 m, Foliage 12.8 m, LandscapeTiles 50 m), each with its HLOD
# layer; the Player source (9000001, TargetGrids Main+Foliage, Scripts/World/WPWalk.lua walks 200 m along +X).
# Play from Here looks through Camera 1003 (Auto Activate for Player, a child of the Player cube). In Play the
# viewport subject IS that view target: `--subject viewport set Camera.*` moves camera 1003 (world pose -> its
# local transform under the walking Player), so the view stays 400 m above the Player while it walks.
# WP_Protocol_HLOD/ is a build product (not in git): the first step builds it (the reply waits for the bake).
# Paint (Foliage grid), VELOCITY and FAR-2 are separate scenarios (see the brief's REMAINDER).
# WP22-LIT: Load All before AND after the palette edit (a new unsaved entity no longer blocks it), a paint stroke
# on the loaded Main cells, a lit frame from 400 m; the boulder_01 type the palette made goes to the Trash at the end.
# The 'orange slab' of p2 was the Player cube itself: Scale 200 on the 100 cm Cube primitive = a 200 m box (fixed to 1x2x1 m).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Когда run Foliage "Add mesh to the palette: boulder_01"
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 1000,1200,-500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,1
Когда run Foliage "Tool: Paint"
Когда run Foliage "Stroke at viewport centre"
Когда run Foliage "Stroke at viewport centre"
Когда run Foliage "Stroke at viewport centre"
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Тогда wp22_paint на месте мазка (центр вьюпорта, загруженная ячейка Main) лежат экземпляры boulder_01 - не 0; освещённый дневной вид с 15 м под 45°, без панели Foliage
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 2
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,40000,-40000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,1
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда wp22_lit освещённый (не Wireframe) кадр сверху 400 м под 45°, солнце днём (50°), без панели Foliage и без оранжевой плиты: застройка вокруг игрока, HLOD до края мира без дыр, листва из мазка у центра
Тогда-вид wp22_lit_view тот же вид, только вьюпорт
Когда run Action "Stop"
Когда run "Content Browser" "Sync to Asset Foliage/boulder_01.defoliage"
Когда run "Content Browser" "Delete (to the Trash)"
